        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 12S/D9000SACU, Stainless Steel Double Cylinder Square Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern style #12S stainless door lever features the sleek square rose combined with a high security double cylinder square deadbolt. A double cylinder entryset, the deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key on both sides of the door. These kinds of locksets are often used on doors that either have windows or are located near windows. The Omnia Double Cylinder Entry Lever Lock Set has a brushed stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Entry Set:</b> TThe deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both exterior and the interior. The lever latch operates from either side of door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55526-SM.jpg?v=1704354514\" width=\"387\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 12S/D9000SACUS32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-door-lever-set-with-square-rose-omnia-12s\"><b>Omnia #12S Entry Door Lever Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Omnia Stainless Steel Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schlage “C” keyway</li>\r\n<li>High Security 1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable faceplate / armor plate for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #12S Square Stainless Double Cylinder Entry Lever Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Lever Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Deadbolt Length: 2-3/8\" square</li> \r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Deadbolt  Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 single cylinder deadbolt, 2 passage levers with rosettes, and mounting screws.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
